<title>UK: Deutsche unit sets 1.0 trillion lire 25-year bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche unit sets 1.0 trillion lire 25-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE NETHERLANDS BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    ONE TRL LIT   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    15.OCT.21</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO-COUPON   ISS PRICE  11.7409   PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    11.5909   YIELD	 9.0 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
